==Portuguese==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|pt|roa-opt|esperar}}, {{m|roa-opt|asperar}}, from {{inh|pt|la|spērāre}}, present active infinitive of {{m|la|spērō|t=hope, expect}}, from {{der|pt|ine-pro|*speh₁-|t=to prosper, to turn out well}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|Portugal}} {{IPA|pt|/ɨʃ.pɨ.ˈɾaɾ/|/iʃ.pɨ.ˈɾaɾ/|/ʃpɨ.ˈɾaɾ/}}
* {{a|Brazil}} {{IPA|pt|/is.pe.ˈɾa(ʁ)/|[ɪs̻.pë.ˈɾä(χ)]}}

===Verb===
{{pt-verb|esper|ar}}

# to [[wait]]
## {{senseid|pt|to await}} {{indtr|pt|por|intr=1|direct=1}} to [[wait]] (for); to [[await]]
##: {{uxi|pt|Eu '''espero''' por sua resposta.|I '''await''' your response.}}
##: {{uxi|pt|Fiquei '''esperando''' no carro.|I '''waited''' in the car.}}
##: {{syn|pt|aguardar}}
## {{senseid|pt|to wait for something to happen}} {{lb|pt|transitive|auxiliary|_|with a verb in the personal infinitive as the second object}} to [[wait]] for {{gloss|not to do anything until}}
##: {{uxi|pt|'''Espere''' o João chegar.|'''Wait''' for John to arrive.}}
##: {{syn|pt|aguardar}}
# to [[hope]]
## {{senseid|pt|to hope for}} {{indtr|pt|por}} to [[hope]] for {{gloss|to really want something}}
##: {{uxi|pt|Eles '''esperam''' pelo fim da guerra.|They '''hope''' for the end of the war.}}
## {{senseid|pt|to hope that}} {{indtr|pt|que|ditr=1|aux=present subjunctive}} to [[hope]] (that) someone does something
##: {{uxi|pt|Eu '''espero''' que gostes do presente.|I '''hope''' you like the gift.}}
## {{senseid|pt|to hope something can be done}} {{lb|pt|auxiliary|_|with a verb in the personal or impersonal infinitive}} to [[hope]] something can be done
##: {{uxi|pt|'''Esperávamos''' comer alguma coisa hoje.|'''We were hoping''' to eat something today.}}
# {{senseid|pt|to expect}} {{indtr|pt|por|intr=1|direct=1}} to [[expect]]; to [[anticipate]] {{gloss|to know or think that something will happen}}
#: {{uxi|pt|É melhor do que eu '''esperava'''.|It is better than I '''expected'''.}}
#: {{uxi|pt|Eu já '''esperava''' por isso mesmo.|I was '''expecting this''' anyway.}}
#: {{syn|pt|aguardar}}

====Conjugation====
{{pt-conj|esper|ar}}

====Further reading====
* {{R:DAN}}

